    |        |       |none  |     0|word_perplexity|↓  |8.7655|±  |   N/A|
    
    ==> unsloth_model_lora_qat_int4_output/lm_eval_quantized.log <==
    |        |       |none  |     0|word_perplexity|↓  |8.3548|±  |   N/A|
    ```

